[{"title":"不涉风波亭歌为糜朝英赋","author":"刘崧","text":"烈烈北风，汤汤横波，大船乘危小船覆，公独不涉留山阿。\n赤鳅鬐，黑龙尾，长鲸峨峨撑白齿，偶一触之命如纸。\n滟滪云深自有堆，海门黑月元无底。\n我昔见公南浦之龙沙，知公作亭非不华。\n上砻翠石凿户牖，下列琴策开烟霞。\n客如流云酒如海，枣已如瓜菊堪采。\n醉歌白雪扬清风，独立东南三十载。\n历观古贤达，孰不恋閒居。\n后有栗里之陶氏，前有东门之二疏。\n公乎公乎又何羡乎鼎食而禄秩，驷马而高车。\n登公亭，酌公酒，风波于公果何有。\n酌公酒，听我歌，风波风波奈我何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23533,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄蜀葵歌","author":"刘崧","text":"君不见园中黄蜀葵，去年一尺长，今年始作花，即见倾太阳。\n朝朝与暮暮，东西逐飞光。\n天清白露下，秋气忽已凉。\n蟏蛸篱落瓠叶黄，支离委绝同秋霜。\n荫根卫足野人语，岂知物性本有常。\n空山无人日色薄，能不念子增烦伤。\n中天北斗何苍苍，千秋万岁临冀方。\n清夜起瞻夜未央，车轮确确回中肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23534,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林之乌美建昌黄节妇","author":"刘崧","text":"林之乌，尾毕逋，雌雄在树声相呼。\n一朝雄死雌不去，衔食自哺巢中雏。\n雏成生羽翼，教之慎出入。\n出巢不似依巢安，上有鹰鹯下沾湿。\n林阴阴，风颵颵，东家火起焚其巢。\n巢空叶枯霜露冷，覆翼其子鸣咬咬。\n雏今老苍自飞止，慈乌端居为雏喜。\n衔草作巢巢更高，白头未遍慈乌死。\n见者共叹息，羡尔林之乌，妇中贞节谁与俱。\n独不见海昏罗田都黄氏，一子之母旌门闾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23535,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠袁鍊师弹琴","author":"刘崧","text":"袁鍊师，好弹琴，不作江南曲，解琴中古音。\n七轸削玉徽裁金，焦桐黑尾朱弦心。\n对之如大宾，宝之甚璆琳。\n时来为予肃危襟，拂拭顾盼愁不禁。\n六月一鼓之，秋风飕飕起云林。\n十月一再抚，凌厉白云开重阴。\n老君坛高夜色迥，神人下听寒萧森。\n口中六律祇自和，头上三花谁与簪。\n忽起抱琴去，振衣度遥岑。\n手援北斗为我斟，独不乐兮忧骎骎。\n苍梧虞舜不复返，帝子佩沈湘水深。\n不尽千古意，别君清夜吟，遥想相思江之浔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23536,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙伯刚之仪真","author":"刘崧","text":"孙侯庙廊具，特达古豪俊。\n十年出禁闼，往往事州郡。\n苍髯玉立秋风高，南浮烟海东云涛。\n中朝更化重守令，似尔简擢非贤劳。\n淮东诸郡临淮道，共说仪真风物好。\n万家歌吹动春云，十里楼船压江岛。\n海有盐错水有鱼，白露红霞春满壶。\n候人出郭鸣马集，日望使君来下车。\n岂无穷困民，所重民父母。\n税赋出鞭笞，伊谁肆苛虎。\n长淮之水何悠悠，行矣不可以久留。\n便令南阳得召父，坐见淮水回清流。\n愿持万古心，送君以千里。\n由来贤达士，感激在知己。\n筼筜谷，金精山，吾独胡为淹留于其间。\n云霄浩荡白日近，飞翰冥冥倘可攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23537,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥三月歌","author":"刘崧","text":"己亥三月尾，大麦小麦黄欲起。\n风从北来雨不止，野雀漫天水漫地。\n高田雀飞可网罗，低田水来将奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23538,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水啮古墓歌","author":"刘崧","text":"河水啮高丘，丘中墓门崩作洲。\n可怜墓中人，不见河水向南流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23539,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题青阳行乐图歌为黄允中赋别","author":"刘崧","text":"使君临湘人，旧住青阳里。\n一从游宦之江郡，长忆青阳好山水。\n梅池之水深瀰瀰，晴绿酿涨青玻瓈。\n蛟龙夜擘山石裂，下注湘水衮衮而东驰。\n群山插天削寒碧，大云嵯峨几千尺。\n苍烟尽覆紫芝岩，日光却射青萝壁。\n图中茸帽紫绮裘，使君行乐何风流。\n长松过雨晓色净，抱琴来此吟清秋。\n琴中有声传太古，振羽流商动林莽。\n淳风已变知者寡，却望苍梧叹脩阻。\n我欲起扫石上苔，为君更置青螺杯。\n手攀琼枝拂明月，骑取白鹤径欲归。\n蓬莱蓬莱微茫不可以度，嗟我民昔捐瘠兮孰遗以哺。\n民今有子兮穫有稌，挽之不留兮君盍予。\n顾思使君兮不可忘，泛澄江兮望临湘。\n临湘山高兮水长，允怀使君兮乐哉青阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23540,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题江村秋兴图为萧性存赋","author":"刘崧","text":"我昔棹船过横月，醉唱吴歌夜中发。\n鹅公岭头月东出，百尺清潭写毛发。\n买鱼溪口烧荻烟，回首旧游今惘然。\n萧君此图自新制，风物何得犹当年。\n两松童童立江浒，松下人家好楼宇。\n雁沈极浦秋水阔，僧入游峰晚钟度。\n伊谁闭户事书史，白发满头心未已。\n岂知扬雄老执戟，万言不如一杯水。\n幅巾美髯行者谁，潇洒似有岩壑姿。\n便思携酒共佐酌，更约入山寻紫芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23541,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔栖辞","author":"刘崧","text":"苍林兮碧溪，我渔兮我栖。\n朝鸣榔于中泽兮，夕余济于澨西。\n波洄沿兮不可以倏迷，路窈窕兮风凄凄。\n反予遵兮故蹊，云鳞鳞兮不可以隮。\n漱白石兮藉芳荑，悄空谷其无人兮，见翩翩之凫鹥。\n志逸而嬉兮得丧以齐，纶不必施兮彼笭箵又焉足赍。\n乐哉洋洋兮，吾乌知尔之为鲦鲿为鲸鲵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23542,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至赣入西江","author":"刘崧","text":"奉诏趋南越，乘舟上赣津。\n脩程兼水石，晴景际冬春。\n海食人多诈，山行马有神。\n谁能轻陆贾，吾已愧涓人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23543,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出蒲岭晚投钟寨","author":"刘崧","text":"乱石閟岩扃，苍烟拥翠屏。\n稻田宜晚赤，山木自冬青。\n客去冲蛮雾，人来睹使星。\n秪惭过冀北，犹拟泛沧溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23544,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南海逢萧氏妹","author":"刘崧","text":"流落怜吾妹，艰难在海隅。\n偶然馀见日，早已绝归途。\n日落苍波阔，天寒碧屿孤。\n失群兼委羽，忍泪更相呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23545,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"包公井","author":"刘崧","text":"止饮端州水，犹为凿地谋。\n在官真不负，于世果何尤。\n光抱一泓月，清涵万古秋。\n尘怀思一涤，欲去复迟留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23546,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡绣水取道赴高州","author":"刘崧","text":"日出城乌起，风高驿马鸣。\n山从云际起，人在树间行。\n溪罟穷深捕，畬刀废薄耕。\n见人茆屋好，浑欲愧平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23547,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"憩金鸡驿亭","author":"刘崧","text":"缘云上驿亭，春色正冥冥。\n千树棠梨白，满山蕉叶青。\n碧潭开匣镜，秀壁拥帷屏。\n尚说客州远，舟行未可停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23548,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下马","author":"刘崧","text":"下马度嵚崟，千溪复万林。\n含沙疑鬼箭，飞草畏蜞针。\n火种通猺俗，山歌杂獠音。\n逢迎暂投息，起坐剧愁心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23549,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出雷阳初渡东洋沟","author":"刘崧","text":"南出雷阳郭，东洋第一沟。\n气蒸通海润，味苦杂潮流。\n蜃垩涂舟遍，蒲茅覆屋稠。\n还闻?风起，飘卷到城楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23550,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至沓磊驿初见海水","author":"刘崧","text":"南海天光白，东洋水气昏。\n汐潮通浦口，涛浪漱山根。\n浩淼涵千古，虚明汇众源。\n平生万里志，临眺豁飞翻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23551,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琼府与广东佥宪潘牧户部主事元伯常相见于琼台驿作此奉柬","author":"刘崧","text":"元子经邦赋，潘郎执法公。\n宁知万里外，相见一亭中。\n潮退沙痕白，春还海气红。\n愿言各努力，归奏大明宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23552,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈赞府山水画赠萧伯循","author":"刘崧","text":"忆在清江上，开轩望远林。\n莺啼双树绿，人静一窗深。\n远道劳行役，芳期阻啸吟。\n如何垂钓者，万事不关心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23553,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题钓鱼图","author":"刘崧","text":"潇洒玄真子，超遥好容颜。\n放船烟树下，把钓水云湾。\n鱼没萍翻石，鸟啼花满山。\n惟应江月上，遥听棹歌还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23554,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪景山水画","author":"刘崧","text":"万木皆冰树，千崖尽玉山。\n精神添去马，毛羽失栖鹇。\n客路微茫外，人家烟水间。\n忆曾登虎鼻，徒步月中还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23555,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题毛泽民云山图","author":"刘崧","text":"水国通吴会，茆堂背楚皋。\n树含春雨润，云挟晚风高。\n幽想栖文豹，深疑叫绿猱。\n谁能招小隐，吾欲棹轻舠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23556,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题方壶寄黄郎中渭云红树图并书","author":"刘崧","text":"春树重重绿，江云冉冉生。\n图传龙虎客，书寄凤凰城。\n花底趋琼佩，松阴奏玉笙。\n何时骑两鹤，方驾上蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23557,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题挟弹图","author":"刘崧","text":"骏马青丝络，联翩挟弹来。\n山疑经洛浦，路似出章台。\n鸟散红花落，莺啼碧树开。\n啼时端听汝，好在莫相猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23558,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵鸣所画林下看云图","author":"刘崧","text":"何地好幽栖，青林带碧溪。\n藤垂猿共挂，叶暗鸟频啼。\n避俗还衣褐，看云只杖藜。\n几时真不负，归问武山西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23559,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水画轴","author":"刘崧","text":"瀑布双垂下，屏风九叠张。\n波光混彭蠡，山势似浔阳。\n松坞栖茆屋，枫林带石梁。\n扁舟如可具，吾意在沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23560,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题古木苍鹰图","author":"刘崧","text":"旷野澄秋气，雄姿肃武威。\n林端方攫立，云外已惊飞。\n秉政乘金令，摧奸顺杀机。\n喜闻阿阁上，鸣凤际春晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23561,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠松江周道士","author":"刘崧","text":"自得游仙术，偏多济世才。\n檄龙行雨去，呼鹤下天来。\n功熟黄金鼎，名登绿玉台。\n还闻从此别，入海访蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23562,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月一日至临濠点驿将归南京赋此奉酬德瑜萧虞部","author":"刘崧","text":"淮水绕濠城，东流不尽情。\n秋光馀客路，云气满神京。\n下马逢仙堠，回舟问水程。\n遥怜一尊酒，持此向谁倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23563,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画扇","author":"刘崧","text":"雪裂齐纨素，天开楚甸图。\n丹崖禅阁并，红渚钓船孤。\n亭晚连松桂，沙明问柳蒲。\n短琴如可抱，清醑得频沽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23564,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四夜对月柬子彦有怀子中兄","author":"刘崧","text":"月出白杨端，乌啼清夜阑。\n絺衣初淅淅，草露已漙漙。\n共喜灯花密，宁辞酒盏乾。\n有兄怀二弟，应自倚楼看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23565,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐二首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"叶落风连树，乌啼月满庭。\n把书双鬓白，呼酒一灯青。\n霜露惊残岁，关河忆旧经。\n职思方在圉，未敢叹飘零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23566,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐二首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"更声引迢递，海气合空濛。\n乌鹊枝枝月，青杨叶叶风。\n山河百战后，城阙五云东。\n往事成炊黍，吾生独转蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23567,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄酬长兴知县萧德瑜四首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"有美长兴宰，曾为工部郎。\n冶金精范器，制锦动成章。\n客鬓何曾白，乡心故自长。\n永怀明月夜，送酒过濠梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23568,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄酬长兴知县萧德瑜四首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"山泽通虞部，图书限职方。\n向来嗟共事，此别更殊乡。\n羸马燕山远，红船霅水长。\n各言思奋励，未可惜参商。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23569,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄酬长兴知县萧德瑜四首 其三","author":"刘崧","text":"近见湖洲客，因传三月书。\n关河千里外，霜露九秋馀。\n作县能知事，携家想定居。\n几时苕霅上，相见采芙蕖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23570,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄酬长兴知县萧德瑜四首 其四","author":"刘崧","text":"五十今逾四，惊添白发多。\n遭逢嗟已盛，报答欲如何。\n边月明山驿，沙冰带塞河。\n远凭南乡雁，一寄北行歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23571,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观北平城陌栽树有感","author":"刘崧","text":"本是山中物，移来近市尘。\n分根烦野客，留荫待行人。\n意接风烟远，光承雨露新。\n闾阎小儿女，攀弄亦何频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23572,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"退食","author":"刘崧","text":"退食还西舍，单居少四邻。\n入门惊落叶，振席愧流尘。\n狞犬偏嘷客，饥猫亦恋人。\n自怜仍自慰，俯仰向谁陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23573,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园秋雨野苋旅生日采供厨喜而成韵","author":"刘崧","text":"旅苋无人种，生来自满畦。\n童童承晓露，濯濯迸秋泥。\n瓜蔓虫偏食，茄科草共齐。\n欣然供采摘，亦足慰羹齑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23574,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西馆积雨","author":"刘崧","text":"西馆门长掩，青樗自满林。\n土垣秋后塌，泥泞雨中深。\n案检秋巡牍，囊馀月俸金。\n君亲恩未报，搔首一长吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23575,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨歇感事","author":"刘崧","text":"雨歇孤城晓，风惊万叶秋。\n晴窗走蝎虎，阴壁上蜗牛。\n抚事惭疏阔，承恩叹谬悠。\n若为裨海岳，未敢问林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23576,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"刘崧","text":"吏牍常堆案，官居不近邻。\n阶庭归去晚，鸡兔坐来亲。\n市酒何曾醉，囊诗未是贫。\n秖惭公禄厚，犹恐负儒巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23577,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感俗","author":"刘崧","text":"衮衮牛车急，纷纷鲋瓮频。\n井咸知苦水，风恶骇奔尘。\n土炕炊烟旧，坭头送酒新。\n总怜边俗恶，牢落异乡人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23578,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其一 胡桃","author":"刘崧","text":"碧露枝枝重，青苞颗颗匀。\n叶深初覆夏，花弱不禁春。\n核隐龟筒小，浆凝密枳新。\n向来谁致汝，吾欲恨平津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23579,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其二 榛子","author":"刘崧","text":"君国充笾实，闺门重贽仪。\n物微将礼意，名重著歌诗。\n错落鸡头小，晶荧鬼目奇。\n欲尝怜病齿，把玩独多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23580,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其三 马蔺子","author":"刘崧","text":"蔺草何人种，丛生故近兰。\n叶长书带小，根瘦彗芒乾。\n牛马何曾食，樵苏自不干。\n遥怜南郡客，更作水仙看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23581,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其四 香水梨","author":"刘崧","text":"香水传嘉号，轮囷碧玉团。\n刀场惭误拟，饤坐喜同欢。\n崖蜜清心润，壶冰溅齿寒。\n宣城空斗大，气味敢同看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23582,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其五 红瓤瓜","author":"刘崧","text":"皮绿何曾别，瓤红故异常。\n晶荧丹玉片，滴沥紫霞浆。\n云落盘杅冷，冰馀齿颊香。\n青门誇五色，见此不能忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23583,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其六 御黄子","author":"刘崧","text":"本是中园李，多因杏接成。\n喜传希世味，因锡御黄名。\n圆瑩含秋色，甘香注露英。\n只今玉食俭，远物未曾徵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23584,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其七 盘松","author":"刘崧","text":"最爱青松树，盘盘偃势奇。\n一擎张羽盖，四面走虬枝。\n引手探巢鹤，低头触兔丝。\n寻常三尺里，赤日未曾知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23585,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其八 偃槐","author":"刘崧","text":"勃窣撑孤柱，婆娑偃一株。\n长条垂带厉，细叶挂流苏。\n暮鹊从争起，秋蜩秪谩呼。\n移床怜美荫，何止蔽千夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23586,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其九 巴丹","author":"刘崧","text":"自是山桃子，蕃名故尔殊。\n皮肤怜外腊，香味爱中腴。\n磊落珠盘石，修圆碧海珠。\n南归思种汝，土性恐难迂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23587,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其十 韭黄","author":"刘崧","text":"都人卖韭黄，腊月破春光。\n土室芳根暖，冰盘嫩叶香。\n十金酬好价，一箸惬初尝。\n何以江南种，青青雪里长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23588,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其十一 慈乌","author":"刘崧","text":"塞北慈乌好，群飞长子孙。\n争巢偏挟势，反哺独知恩。\n秋树霜前绕，寒枝月下蹲。\n往来随候雁，此理竟谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23589,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平十二咏 其十二 黄鼬","author":"刘崧","text":"黄鼬雄于鼠，萧骚散尾毛。\n窥檐林雀噪，出穴屋鸡号。\n攘攘缘高树，踆踆伏浅蒿。\n惟馀管成子，犹得利霜毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23590,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"防微馆","author":"刘崧","text":"高馆人难到，层阶草漫生。\n野蒿深没马，高树静啼莺。\n问俗时询野，防微早计程。\n自无尘土近，况有柏风清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23591,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕次吕佥宪韵","author":"刘崧","text":"华月丽秋天，寒光瑩若泉。\n星移银汉节，花合绮楼烟。\n鹊影浮珠贝，蛛丝罥藕莲。\n人间与天上，安得两团圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23592,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"心清一首奉柬吕徐二佥宪","author":"刘崧","text":"心清馀白日，地迥隔红尘。\n马渴时窥井，乌驯不畏人。\n衣冠更异俗，书律在同寅。\n辽海通东北，应知服化淳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23593,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独归","author":"刘崧","text":"吏散独归迟，西庭欲暮时。\n猫戏风捲叶，鸡坐雨横枝。\n白雪谁能和，清觞谩自持。\n故园秋色早，回首意兼悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23594,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起","author":"刘崧","text":"楼笳低塞雁，邻火起庭鸦。\n城歇征人柝，门喧过客车。\n风枝涂白露，霜叶覆黄沙。\n底事边隅梦，经时不到家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23595,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]